{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus data source for Arch Systems cache metrics",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "5.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "timeseries",
      "name": "Time series",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "stat",
      "name": "Stat",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "bargauge",
      "name": "Bar gauge",
      "version": ""
    }
  ],
  "title": "Cache Handler — Redis & Circuit Breaker",
  "description": "Cache hit/miss rates, circuit breaker state, retries, Redis connection health, and native fallback status. All metrics sourced from arch_cache_handler_*, arch_cache_circuit_breaker_*, and arch_redis_* Prometheus metric families.",
  "tags": ["arch-systems", "cache", "redis", "circuit-breaker"],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Alert Rules Reference",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "content": "### 🚨 Active Prometheus Alerts\n\n| Severity | Alert | Condition | Runbook |\n|----------|-------|-----------|---------|\n| 🔴 **Critical** | CircuitBreakerOpen | CB OPEN for >5m | docs/runbooks/circuit-breaker-open.md |\n| 🔴 **Critical** | RedisConnectionDown | Redis gauge = 0 for >1m | docs/runbooks/redis-connection-down.md |\n| 🟡 **Warning** | CircuitBreakerFlapping | >6 transitions/5m | docs/runbooks/circuit-breaker-open.md |\n| 🟡 **Warning** | CircuitBreakerRejectingRequests | Reject rate > 0 | docs/runbooks/circuit-breaker-open.md |\n| 🟡 **Warning** | HighCacheFailureRate | >50% errors over 5m | docs/runbooks/redis-connection-down.md |\n| 🟡 **Warning** | CacheHitRateDropped | <50% hit rate for 10m | docs/runbooks/redis-connection-down.md |\n| 🔵 **Info** | CacheRetriesElevated | >0.1 retries/s | docs/runbooks/circuit-breaker-open.md |\n| 🔵 **Info** | RedisNativeFallbackActive | Fallback for >5m | docs/runbooks/redis-connection-down.md |\n\n**Alertmanager:** 9093 | **Config:** ops/alertmanager/alertmanager.yaml | **Dashboard:** Grafana → Alerting → Notification channels",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Cache Hit Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.95 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "clamp_min(arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"get\",status=\"hit\"} / (arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"get\",status=\"hit\"} + arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"get\",status=\"miss\"}), 0)",
          "legendFormat": "Hit Rate",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cache Error Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.05 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "clamp_max(arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"get\",status=\"error\"} / (arch_cache_handler_calls_total{operation=\"get\"} > 0), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Error Rate",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Active Circuit Breaker State",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "arch_redis_connection_info{status=\"ready\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Redis Connected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Op Rate (Calls/sec)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_handler_calls_total{operation=\"get\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "GET",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_handler_calls_total{operation=\"set\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "SET",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_handler_calls_total{operation=\"update_tags\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "INVALIDATE",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Get Status (Total)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"get\",status=\"hit\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Hits",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"get\",status=\"miss\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Misses",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"get\",status=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Errors",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Retries & Circuit Breaker Events",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_handler_retries_total[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Retries",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"open\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Breaker Opens",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"close\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Breaker Closes",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"reject\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Breaker Rejects",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Circuit Breaker Transition Accumulator",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 20 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"open\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Opens",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"half_open\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Half-Opens",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"close\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Closes",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"reject\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Rejects",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "arch_cache_handler_retries_total",
          "legendFormat": "Total Retries",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Redis Connection Status",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "arch_redis_connection_info{status=\"ready\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Redis Connected",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Native Fallback Active",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 22 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "semi-dark-yellow", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "arch_redis_native_fallback",
          "legendFormat": "Native Fallback",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Set & Update Errors Per Interval",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"set\",status=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Set Errors",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_handler_ops_total{operation=\"update_tags\",status=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Update Tags Errors",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Circuit Breaker Audit Event Rate",
      "description": "Rate of circuit breaker state transitions per minute, read from the Prometheus gauge derived from the Redis audit log list length and event counters",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"open\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Opens (5m avg)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"half_open\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Half-Opens (5m avg)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"close\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Closes (5m avg)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"reject\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Rejects (5m avg)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Audit Log Events — Transition Breakdown (24h)",
      "description": "24-hour cumulative view of circuit breaker transitions. Spikes indicate cascading failures or recovery cycles across all pods.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"open\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "Opens (24h)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"half_open\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "Half-Opens (24h)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"close\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "Closes (24h)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(arch_cache_circuit_breaker_events_total{transition=\"reject\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "Rejects (24h)",
          "intervalFactor": 2
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
